WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.883
Here's what you'll be able to
do by the end of this module,

2
00:00:02.883 --> 00:00:05.587
which takes about ninety-five
minutes with the lab.

3
00:00:05.587 --> 00:00:10.250
You'll explain the four ways Resource
Manager differs from Graph for a script.

4
00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:13.014
You'll page a Resource
Graph query to the end,

5
00:00:13.014 --> 00:00:17.237
and say when Resource Graph can't
page and why that must stop the run.

6
00:00:17.237 --> 00:00:21.975
You'll explain why an empty result can
mean no access, not a clean estate.

7
00:00:21.975 --> 00:00:26.140
You'll read the Arc machine,
extension, SQL Server instance,

8
00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:30.550
policy assignment and policy state
records, and the traps in each.

9
00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:35.023
And you'll say which Windows Server and
SQL Server versions are past support,

10
00:00:35.023 --> 00:00:36.988
and run the five checks on fixtures.

11
00:00:36.988 --> 00:00:38.299
You need Module 1.

12
00:00:38.299 --> 00:00:41.725
Lab 2 needs a test subscription
in commercial Azure,

13
00:00:41.725 --> 00:00:44.980
never production, with a
few Arc-enabled servers.
